title: Women's Liberation
new-page: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; feminism_timer +=9
is-card: true
card-image: img/kpd_women.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: party_affairs
view-if: feminism_timer <=0

= Women's Liberation

A Marxist party that excludes women is no Marxist party at all. Still, the fact that we, one of the most vocal in our support of women's liberation, struggle to connect with them is problematic . How will we deal with this?

- @female_organization: Expand our women's organizations.
- @campaign_women: Include and acknowledge the voices of women within our media and propaganda.
- @bourgeois_feminism: Oppose feminism and bourgeois deception.
- @nothing: We can postpone this matter for later.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@female_organization
on-arrival: resources -= 1; women_connection += 0.5;

We increase funding to our women organizations and agitation.

@campaign_women
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; women_connection += 0.25; new_middle_kpd += (1*(1-dissent)+(women_connection)); workers_kpd += 3*(1*(1-dissent)+(women_connection)); unemployed_kpd += 3*(1*(1-dissent)+(women_connection))

We change and create newspapers and posters to address women specifically, while connecting their struggle with the communist cause.  [? if women_connection <2: Our outreach to women isn't particularly strong. More agitation and organizing among women may be necessary. ?] [? if women_connection >=2: Our attempts at atracting women have finally bore fruit.?] 

@bourgeois_feminism
on-arrival: women_connection += 0.25; workers_dnvp -= 2; workers_spd -= 2; workers_ddp -=2; socialism += 2*(1-dissent)

We attack feminism as serving bourgeois interests while doing nothing to truely liberate working class women.

@nothing

We have decided to postpone this matter for later, hopefully it doesn't backfire...

- @return: Continue...